"What data REmu does and doesn't collect" = "REmu 收集和不收集哪些数据";
"Last updated: April 26, 2026" = "最后更新：2026 年 4 月 26 日";
"View Online" = "在线查看";
"REmu is built to respect your privacy. This document describes what data the app handles and what it does not." = "REmu 的设计宗旨是尊重你的隐私。本文档说明本应用处理哪些数据，以及不处理哪些数据。";
"No Personal Data Collected" = "不收集个人数据";
"REmu does not collect, store, or transmit any personally identifiable information. We do not require an account, and we do not log your activity." = "REmu 不会收集、存储或传输任何可识别个人身份的信息。我们不要求注册账户，也不会记录你的活动。";
"Local-Only Storage" = "仅本地存储";
"All ROM files, save states, and screenshots remain on your device, inside the app's protected sandbox. They are never uploaded to any server, shared with us, or made available to third parties." = "所有 ROM 文件、即时存档和截图都保留在你的设备上，位于本应用受保护的沙盒内。它们绝不会被上传到任何服务器、分享给我们或提供给第三方。";
"No Analytics or Tracking" = "无分析或追踪";
"This version of REmu does not include any analytics SDK, tracking pixel, or third-party telemetry. Crash reports, if shared, are handled by Apple's standard system tooling and require your explicit opt-in via iOS Settings." = "此版本的 REmu 不包含任何分析 SDK、追踪像素或第三方遥测。崩溃报告（如有分享）由 Apple 的标准系统工具处理，并需要你在 iOS 设置中明确选择启用。";
"Advertising" = "广告";
"The current version of REmu does not display advertisements. If a future release introduces ad-supported features, this policy will be updated and consent will be requested where required (e.g., via App Tracking Transparency)." = "当前版本的 REmu 不展示广告。如果未来版本引入由广告支持的功能，本政策将会更新，并在必要时请求你的同意（例如通过 App Tracking Transparency）。";
"External Links" = "外部链接";
"The app's tutorial may reference public websites such as itch.io for legal homebrew games. Following an external link takes you to the third party's own privacy environment, which is governed by their policies, not this one." = "本应用的教程可能会引用诸如 itch.io 等公开网站，以提供合法的自制游戏。点击外部链接会将你带到第三方自己的隐私环境，该环境受其自身政策管辖，而非本政策。";
"Children's Privacy" = "儿童隐私";
"REmu is not directed at children under 13 and does not knowingly collect data from anyone. If you believe a child has provided personal data through this app, please contact us so we can confirm there is nothing on our end to remove." = "REmu 并非面向 13 岁以下儿童，也不会有意收集任何人的数据。如果你认为有儿童通过本应用提供了个人数据，请联系我们，以便我们确认我们这边没有任何需要删除的内容。";
"Contact" = "联系方式";
"For privacy questions, please contact: fatihkcf@gmail.com" = "如有隐私相关问题，请联系：fatihkcf@gmail.com";
"Changes" = "变更";
"We may revise this policy. The \"Last updated\" date above reflects the most recent revision." = "我们可能会修订本政策。上方的\"最后更新\"日期反映了最近一次修订。";
"Welcome to REmu" = "欢迎使用 REmu";
"Terms of Use" = "使用条款";
"Privacy Policy" = "隐私政策";
"Please review and accept the terms before continuing." = "请在继续之前查看并接受条款。";
"Below are the terms you accepted when first launching REmu." = "以下是你首次启动 REmu 时接受的条款。";
"1. No Bundled Games or BIOS" = "1. 不附带游戏或 BIOS";
"REmu does not provide, distribute, or include any commercial game ROMs, BIOS files, or other copyrighted content. The only software bundled with this application is the original Glowchase demo and the emulation framework itself." = "REmu 不提供、不分发、也不包含任何商业游戏 ROM、BIOS 文件或其他受版权保护的内容。本应用唯一附带的软件是原创的 Glowchase 演示和模拟框架本身。";
"2. Your Responsibility" = "2. 你的责任";
"You are solely responsible for the legality of any file you import into this application. By importing a ROM or BIOS, you confirm that (a) you legally own the original game cartridge, disc, or console, and you produced the file by dumping hardware you own, OR (b) the file is free homebrew, public domain, or otherwise covered by a license that permits your use." = "你须对导入本应用的任何文件的合法性独自承担责任。导入 ROM 或 BIOS 即表示你确认：(a) 你合法拥有原版游戏卡带、光盘或主机，并且该文件是通过转储你自己拥有的硬件生成的；或 (b) 该文件为免费自制软件、公共领域内容，或以其他方式获得了允许你使用的许可。";
"3. No ROM Sharing" = "3. 禁止分享 ROM";
"REmu does not include, link to, or facilitate access to any ROM download service. Downloading or distributing ROMs of games you do not own is illegal in most jurisdictions and constitutes a violation of these terms and your local copyright law." = "REmu 不包含、不链接、也不为访问任何 ROM 下载服务提供便利。下载或分发你并不拥有的游戏 ROM 在大多数司法管辖区均属违法，并构成对本条款及你当地版权法的违反。";
"4. Privacy" = "4. 隐私";
"REmu stores all save states and imported files locally on your device. No game data, save states, or imported ROMs are uploaded to any server, and the developer has no access to them." = "REmu 将所有即时存档和导入的文件本地存储在你的设备上。任何游戏数据、即时存档或导入的 ROM 都不会被上传到任何服务器，开发者也无法访问它们。";
"5. No Warranty" = "5. 无担保";
"REmu is provided \"as-is\" without warranty of any kind, express or implied. The developer is not liable for any damages, data loss, or legal consequences arising from your use of this software or any content you choose to load into it." = "REmu 按\"原样\"提供，不附带任何明示或暗示的担保。对于因你使用本软件或你选择加载的任何内容而引起的任何损害、数据丢失或法律后果，开发者概不负责。";
"6. Trademarks & Affiliation" = "6. 商标与隶属关系";
"REmu is an independent project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Nintendo Co., Ltd., Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc., Microsoft Corporation, or any other console manufacturer. All trademarks, product names, console designs, and logos are the property of their respective owners. References to console identifiers within the application are made for technical interoperability only." = "REmu 是一个独立项目，与 Nintendo Co., Ltd.、Sony Interactive Entertainment Inc.、Microsoft Corporation 或任何其他主机制造商均无隶属关系，亦未获得其认可或赞助。所有商标、产品名称、主机设计和徽标均归其各自所有者所有。本应用中对主机标识符的引用仅用于技术互操作性目的。";
"I have read and agree to the terms above" = "我已阅读并同意上述条款";
"Continue" = "继续";
"Close" = "关闭";
"How to Use" = "使用方法";
"Legal Notice" = "法律声明";
"REmu is an emulation platform. It does not include any game software or BIOS files. You are solely responsible for ensuring you have the legal right to use any files you load into this app." = "REmu 是一个模拟平台。它不包含任何游戏软件或 BIOS 文件。你须独自负责确保自己拥有使用加载到本应用中的任何文件的合法权利。";
"Step %lld" = "第 %lld 步";
"Obtain ROMs Legally" = "合法获取 ROM";
"Dump your own physical cartridges or discs using a dedicated dumper device. You must own the original media. Do not download ROMs from the internet — sharing or distributing copyrighted game files is illegal." = "使用专用的转储设备转储你自己的实体卡带或光盘。你必须拥有原版媒介。请勿从互联网下载 ROM——分享或分发受版权保护的游戏文件属于违法行为。";
"Free Legal Alternatives" = "免费合法的替代选择";
"If you don't have a dumper, many systems have free homebrew and public-domain games you can use legally — for example, GB Studio releases on itch.io, NES homebrew (Nebs 'n Debs, Witch n Wiz), or Genesis SGDK demos. Always read the license before importing a file." = "如果你没有转储设备，许多系统都有可供你合法使用的免费自制游戏和公共领域游戏——例如 itch.io 上发布的 GB Studio 作品、NES 自制游戏（Nebs 'n Debs、Witch n Wiz），或 Genesis SGDK 演示。导入文件前请务必阅读许可协议。";
"Import Your ROM" = "导入你的 ROM";
"Tap the + button on the Library screen. Select your ROM file from the Files app. Supported formats: .nes (NES), .smc/.sfc (SNES), .gb/.gbc/.gba (Game Boy family), .md/.gen/.smd (Genesis), .sms (Master System), .gg (Game Gear), .bin/.cue (PS1)." = "在库界面点按 + 按钮。从 Files 应用中选择你的 ROM 文件。支持的格式：.nes（NES）、.smc/.sfc（SNES）、.gb/.gbc/.gba（Game Boy 系列）、.md/.gen/.smd（Genesis）、.sms（Master System）、.gg（Game Gear）、.bin/.cue（PS1）。";
"Place BIOS Files" = "放置 BIOS 文件";
"Some systems require a BIOS dump from your own console. Place BIOS files in the /System folder inside the app's Documents directory (Files → REmu → System). You must dump the BIOS yourself from hardware you own." = "某些系统需要从你自己的主机转储的 BIOS。请将 BIOS 文件放入本应用 Documents 目录内的 /System 文件夹中（Files → REmu → System）。你必须自行从你拥有的硬件中转储 BIOS。";
"Launch & Play" = "启动并游玩";
"Tap any ROM card to start. Use the on-screen controller, or connect a MFi/Bluetooth gamepad. Use the menu (⋮) to save/load states or return to the library." = "点按任意 ROM 卡片即可开始。使用屏幕上的控制器，或连接 MFi/蓝牙手柄。使用菜单（⋮）来保存/加载存档或返回库。";
"Save States" = "即时存档";
"Tap the Save button during gameplay to create a snapshot. Load it anytime via Quick Load. States are stored locally in /SaveStates and are never uploaded anywhere." = "游戏过程中点按保存按钮即可创建快照。可随时通过快速加载来载入它。存档本地存储在 /SaveStates 中，绝不会被上传到任何地方。";
