"How to add a PlayStation BIOS" = "如何添加 PlayStation BIOS";
"PlayStation games need a BIOS file dumped from your own console. REmu does not include one. Other systems (NES, SNES, Game Boy, Genesis, etc.) do not need a BIOS." = "PlayStation 游戏需要从你自己的主机转储的 BIOS 文件。REmu 不包含 BIOS。其他系统（NES、SNES、Game Boy、Genesis 等）不需要 BIOS。";
"Dump your own BIOS" = "转储你自己的 BIOS";
"You must legally own a PlayStation console and dump its BIOS yourself. The file is commonly named scph5501.bin (US), scph5500.bin (Japan) or scph5502.bin (Europe). Do not download BIOS files from the internet." = "你必须合法拥有一台 PlayStation 主机并自行转储其 BIOS。该文件通常命名为 scph5501.bin（美版）、scph5500.bin（日版）或 scph5502.bin（欧版）。请勿从互联网下载 BIOS 文件。";
"Open Files → REmu → System" = "打开 Files → REmu → System";
