"Copy the BIOS file in" = "将 BIOS 文件复制进去";
"Place the .bin BIOS file into that System folder. You can keep more than one regional BIOS there at the same time." = "将 .bin BIOS 文件放入该 System 文件夹中。你可以同时在其中保留多个地区版本的 BIOS。";
"Import a game and play" = "导入游戏并游玩";
"Add a PlayStation disc (.bin/.cue, .pbp or .chd) from the library, then tap it to launch. PS1 is experimental — speed varies by game and device." = "从库中添加一张 PlayStation 光盘（.bin/.cue、.pbp 或 .chd），然后点按它即可启动。PS1 为实验性功能——速度因游戏和设备而异。";
